    event_title="Independence Day"
    event_sub_title="Explore the latest photos from our Independence Day celebration at ISOE"
    paragraph=` On August 15th, 2023, Icon School of Excellence
                                celebrated the 77th Independence Day with a
                                series of patriotic events. The program,
                                attended by Chairman Mr. Nishanth N, Principal
                                Ms. Alphonsa George, teachers, and students,
                                featured inspiring speeches, songs, dances, and
                                a synchronized march past. The dedication and
                                enthusiasm of both students and staff made the
                                celebration a heartfelt tribute to the nation’s
                                independence`
